  V0 = rails-html-sanitizer 1.4.2  (pre-CVE-2022-32209)
  V1 = rails-html-sanitizer 1.4.3  (CVE-2022-32209 fix = TARGET, INCOMPLETE)
  V2 = rails-html-sanitizer 1.4.4  (CVE-2022-23520 fix = COMPLETE)
  INVARIANT across all three: loofah 2.19.1, nokogiri 1.13.10 (libxml 2.10.3).
  App /health confirmed:  ok rhs=1.4.2 loofah=2.19.1 / rhs=1.4.3 / rhs=1.4.4.
  loofah 2.19.1 has no Loofah.html5_mode? -> loofah_using_html5? == false -> the 1.4.3 guard's
