--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  v0 tags  -> <svg><style><img src=x onerror=alert(1)></style></svg>            RAW  -> executes
  v0 class -> <svg><style><img src=x onerror=alert(1)></style></svg>            RAW  -> executes
  v1 tags  -> <svg>&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</svg>                     style removed + escaped -> BLOCKED
  v1 class -> <svg><style><img src=x onerror=alert(1)></style></svg>            RAW  -> executes  (RESIDUAL)
  v2 tags  -> <svg><style>&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</style></svg>      CDATA escaped -> BLOCKED
  v2 class -> <svg><style>&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</style></svg>      CDATA escaped -> BLOCKED
(On v1 tags the sanitizer prints: "WARNING: Rails::Html::SafeListSanitizer: removing 'style' from
safelist, should not be combined with 'select'" -- confirming remove_safelist_tag_combinations fired.)

